<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highlands year net loss 11 mln Kina.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highlands year net loss 11 mln Kina.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million Papua New Guinea kina unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 7.86 vs profit 7.47</p>
<p>    Net				loss 11.01 vs profit 7.74</p>
<p>    Final dividend (toea)		 nil vs 1.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Highlands Gold Ltd is a gold miner whose major asset is a 25 percent stake in the Porgera gold mine in Papua New Guinea. (One kina is equivalent to about 76.5 U.S. cents.)  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (toea)		1.00 vs 2.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  117.44 vs 99.70</p>
<p>    Other income			  11.66 vs 22.34</p>
<p>    Shr (toea)			loss 1.78 vs gain 1.37</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					2.20 vs 0.24</p>
<p>    Interest				 4.16 vs 4.59</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  28.26 vs 34.13</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
